{"title":"Grave Knight","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 44 Skeleton that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (2.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=0\">Lv 0 <span>389</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>64</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>65</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>81</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>122</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>88</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>15</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>81</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grave-knight?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>11</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP 